However, when migrating an extension to the LibTorch stable ABI, there is no corresponding registration equivalent. Thus, extensions that expose stateful C++ objects cannot fully migrate to the stable ABI without redesigning their public APIs. 

### Pitch

Provide a stable-ABI custom-class registration API usable from STABLE_TORCH_LIBRARY, with functionality corresponding to the existing custom-class API.
